<!-- Canonical: / is primary; /landing 301s to / (alias kept for old links, not a separate index entry). /register is self-signup; /register-college is college intake (separate). Sync: Seo.tsx PUBLIC_EXACT (10) + robots.txt + docs/seo.md. -->
<!-- Deploy (VITE_SITE_URL SSOT): production host comes from VITE_SITE_URL (Vercel env: Production + Preview). At build/deploy, replace https://campusflow.dev below + robots.txt Sitemap + index.html canonical/OG + .well-known/security.txt Canonical with the SAME host (Vercel URL or custom domain after DNS). Seo.tsx falls back to campusflow.dev when unset — always set the env to avoid indexing the placeholder. Verify: dist/index.html canonical == Seo.tsx canonical == sitemap locs == robots Sitemap. -->
<!-- security.txt: add /.well-known/security.txt (contact + expires) at deploy — devops lane, not part of sitemap. -->
